--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Project   : Bada
   Author    : Kyujin Cho <kyujin.cho>
   Homepage  : https://github.com/kyujin-cho/Bada
   License   : MIT License (as published in the project's LICENSE file)

   Used as the reference for:
     - Quick Share (offline) session establishment and encryption key
       derivation semantics (EC P-256 key agreement + PBKDF2 password-based
       key derivation + AES-256-GCM data plane);
     - PIN / verification-code derivation that both endpoints compute
       independently from the negotiated shared secret;
     - transfer efficiency patterns (single handshake per multi-file session,
       secret reuse across a whole transfer, large 256 KiB chunks, batched /
       per-file acknowledgment instead of per-chunk acknowledgment).

